  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3312,
      "text": "Whatever you have been given is only an enjoyment and adornment of the life of this world, but what is with Allah is better and more lasting. Will you not then understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 339,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3313,
      "text": "Is one whom We promised a good promise – which he is going to obtain – like one whom We gave the pleasure of the life of this world, then on the Day of Resurrection he will be among those summoned [to Hellfire]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3314,
      "text": "And [beware of] the Day when He will call out to them and say, “Where are those whom you claimed to be My partners?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3315,
      "text": "Those against whom the word will be fulfilled[30] will say, “Our Lord, these are the ones whom we led astray; we led them astray as we ourselves went astray. We disassociate ourselves [from them] before You; it was not us that they used to worship[31].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 63,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3316,
      "text": "Then they will be told, “Call upon your [so-called] partners [for help].” They will call upon them, but will receive no response. They will see the punishment, wishing that they had followed guidance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3317,
      "text": "On the Day when He will call out to them, saying, “What response did you give to the messengers?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3318,
      "text": "They will be dumbstruck[32] on that Day, not even able to ask one another.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3319,
      "text": "But whoever repents and believes, and does righteous deeds, he will be among the successful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3320,
      "text": "Your Lord creates and chooses what He wills; they have no choice. Glorified is Allah and Exalted is He far above what they associate with Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3321,
      "text": "Your Lord knows all that their hearts conceal and all that they reveal.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qasas",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Stories",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 393,
      "ruku": 340,
      "hizbQuarter": 157,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3322,
      "text": "He is Allah: none has the right to be worshiped except Him. All praise belongs to Him in this life and the Hereafter. His is the Judgment, and to Him you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 28,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَصَصِ",
